            <title>0.1.4-beta</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 12:43:33 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://typoless.app</link>
            <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
            <sparkle:version>92</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4-beta</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Setup</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Setup opens whenever Typoless cannot read text, not only the first time it runs. Installing the app again used to skip the one screen that explains what is missing.</li>
    <li>Allowing Accessibility opens one window, not two. The system asks the first time, and after that the button goes straight to the right pane of System Settings.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Settings</h3>
<ul>
    <li>The update rows say less: a title and a switch, with no note under them.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
