        <item>
            <title>0.1.3-beta</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:43:08 +0200</pubDate>
            <link>https://typoless.app</link>
            <sparkle:channel>beta</sparkle:channel>
            <sparkle:version>89</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.3-beta</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Updates</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Typoless checks for a new version from the first launch, and no longer asks a question about it on the second. The switch is in Settings, under General.</li>
    <li>A new version marks the menu bar icon instead of opening a window in the middle of what you are writing. The menu says so, and you decide when to look.</li>
    <li>The update window now says what is in the release. This page is it.</li>
    <li>Settings gained a Check Now button, and says when it last looked.</li>
</ul>
<p>Nothing is ever installed without you.</p>
]]></description>
